:"6x2_7cd_tw2","title":"光祿大夫","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-076","source_id":"s-jinshu-076-wangbin","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line046","quote":"彬字世儒。少稱雅正，弱冠，不就州郡之命。光祿大夫傅祗辟為掾。後與兄廙俱渡江，為揚州刺史劉機建武長史。元帝引為鎮東賊曹參軍，轉典兵參軍。豫討華軼功，封都亭侯，湣帝召為尚書郎，以道險不就。遷建安太守，徙義興內史，未之職，轉軍諮祭酒。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line046:m0024"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-jin076-wangbin-46-20:a001","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line046","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"光祿大夫","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangbin:line046:m0024","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"只按本段任命、轉任、降職或見稱保存；未知起訖留空，不以卒年終止全部稱號，也不把府主職位作受任者本官。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005","text":"楷子瓚娶楊駿女，然楷素輕駿，與之不平。駿既執政，乃轉為衛尉，遷太子少師，優遊無事，默如也。及駿誅，楷以婚親收付廷尉，將加法。是日事倉卒，誅戮縱橫，眾人為之震恐。楷容色不變，舉動自若，索紙筆與親故書。賴侍中傅祗救護得免，猶坐去官。太保衛瓘、太宰亮稱楷貞正不阿附，宜蒙爵土，乃封臨海侯，食邑二千戶。代楚王瑋為北軍中候，加散騎常侍。瑋怨瓘、亮斥己任楷，楷聞之，不敢拜，轉為尚書。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"瓚","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BCB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"楊駿","kind":"person","person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"女","kind":"person","person_id":"wpv_w1b_yvx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"駿","kind":"person","person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"駿","kind":"person","person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"駿","kind":"person","person_id":"603_131_11e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"傅祗","kind":"person","person_id":"6x2_7cd_tw2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"衛瓘","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0119","start":119,"end":122,"surface":"太宰亮","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0148","start":148,"end":151,"surface":"楚王瑋","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0163","start":163,"end":164,"surface":"瑋","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0165","start":165,"end":166,"surface":"瓘","kind":"person","person_id":"q1l_utb_rfn_**AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0167","start":167,"end":168,"surface":"亮","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0169","start":169,"end":170,"surface":"己","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0171","start":171,"end":172,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family:p005:m0173","start":173,"end":174,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_BC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":85,"last_line":85,"revision_id":2506399,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peikai-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peikai-ws2506399"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p006","text":"時關中饑荒，百姓相噉，加以疾癘，盜賊公行。模力不能制，乃鑄銅人鐘鼎為釜器以易穀，議者非之。東海王越表徵模為司空，遣中書監傅祗代之。模謀臣淳於定說模曰：「關中天府之國，霸王之地。今以不能綏撫而還，既於聲望有虧，又公兄弟唱起大事，而並在朝廷，若自強則有專權之罪，弱則受制於人，非公之利也。」模納其言，不就徵。表遣世子保為西中郎將、東羌校尉，鎮上邽，秦州刺史裴苞距之。模使帳下都尉陳安率眾攻苞，苞奔安定。太守賈疋以郡迎苞，模遣軍司謝班伐疋，疋退盧水。其年，進位太尉、大都督。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","voice_scope":"史臣敘事","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p006:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"模","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADBD","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"mo","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/identity-readings.json#mo"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p006:m0045","start":45,"end":49,"surface":"東海王越","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADBA","status":"contextual_provisional"